    "2 lime slices",
    "1 teaspoon white sugar, or more to taste",
    "0.25 cup ice cubes, or as needed",
    "1 (1.5 fluid ounce) jigger rum (such as Bacardi®)",
    "4.5 ounces diet lemon-lime soda (such as Diet Sprite®)"
